# ── GEO LLM analysis (main GEO function, always on) ──────────────
# The core SEO/AEO/GEO scoring is fully deterministic and needs NO keys.
# The GEO LLM analysis — an actual generative-engine read of the page — is the
# main GEO function and runs on EVERY analysis. It needs no key to be decided;
# it runs whenever a key below is configured, otherwise the report explicitly
# notes the LLM read was skipped. There is no UI toggle or CLI flag to turn it
# off. Works with any OpenAI-compatible provider:
#
#   GEO_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...            # required (or OPENAI_API_KEY)
#   GEO_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
#                                     # DeepSeek:    https://api.deepseek.com/v1
#                                     # Groq:        https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#                                     # OpenRouter:  https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#                                     # Ollama local: http://localhost:11434/v1 (no key needed)
#   GEO_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini         # optional; auto-guessed per provider
#
# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PORT=3100
